WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.836
-Several prominent Republicans

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.670
are continuing to push back

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:07.006
against both mask rules
and COVID vaccines,

00:00:07.006 --> 00:00:09.308
even though we now
have significant evidence

00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:11.677
that the vaccines cut down
on transmission,

00:00:11.677 --> 00:00:13.579
can help protect others,
and get us back to normal.

00:00:13.579 --> 00:00:15.581
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:15.581 --> 00:00:19.552
♪♪

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:21.621
When it comes to masks
and vaccinations,

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:23.289
there have been a lot
of dumb opinions.

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:26.859
For example, yesterday, former
GOP Congressman Jason Chaffetz,

00:00:26.859 --> 00:00:28.394 line:0%
who's now
a Fox News contributor,

00:00:28.394 --> 00:00:29.862 line:0%
trotted out what
he apparently thought

00:00:29.862 --> 00:00:32.532 line:0%
was a brilliant analogy
to criticize mandates.

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:33.833 line:0%
-I think one of the principles

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.035 line:0%
that people just tend
to forget about,

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:37.703 line:0%
which is the proper role
of government.

00:00:37.703 --> 00:00:40.072 line:0%
The proper role of government,
is to inform the public,

00:00:40.072 --> 00:00:42.074 line:0%
but we believe, in the
United States of America,

00:00:42.074 --> 00:00:43.743 line:0%
about self-determination,

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:46.145 line:0%
that we get to make
those decisions.

00:00:46.145 --> 00:00:47.146 line:0%
-Yes.
-The government can help

00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:48.948 line:0%
provide the information,

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:51.951 line:0%
they have
a Centers for Disease Control,

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:55.989 line:0%
but there are lots of diseases
that kids can potentially get.

00:00:55.989 --> 00:01:00.493 line:0%
I mean, we could all not die
driving down the freeway

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:03.229 line:0%
at 55 or 70 or 80 miles an hour,

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:05.932 line:0%
if we all drove
three miles an hour.

00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:07.033 line:0%
But you know what?

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:08.301 line:0%
We put the warnings up there.

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:09.802 line:0%
We put a speed limit up there.

00:01:09.802 --> 00:01:12.171 line:0%
We say, "We'd rather
you not do this."

00:01:12.171 --> 00:01:13.806 line:0%
And there are consequences

00:01:13.806 --> 00:01:16.942 line:0%
and some people, you know,
suffer those consequences.

00:01:16.942 --> 00:01:20.313 line:0%
But self-determination
is the principle, here.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.048
-Ooh, I hate to be one
of those speed limit signs

00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:24.250
you seem to hate,
but slow down, pal.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.952
First of all,
do you think speed limits

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:27.853
are just suggestions?
If that were the case,

00:01:27.853 --> 00:01:30.957
wouldn't the signs be phrased
a little differently?

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:32.525
Also, the proper role
of government

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:33.993
isn't just to inform the public.

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:35.428
Sure, it's one of the roles.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.696
You want them to inform,
but you also want them to act.

00:01:37.696 --> 00:01:40.199
FDR didn't give
a Fireside Chat in 1940

00:01:40.199 --> 00:01:42.302
saying, "Paris has fallen
to Nazi Germany.

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.737
Please let us know
how you'd like us to proceed."

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:46.739
Also, I love how he
accidentally backed himself

00:01:46.739 --> 00:01:49.208
into arguing for mandates
when he admitted

00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:51.477
there are consequences
for breaking the speed limit.

00:01:51.477 --> 00:01:52.678
A rule set by the government

00:01:52.678 --> 00:01:54.414
that has consequences
for breaking it?

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:56.248
That's a mandate, bro.
You sound like a guy

00:01:56.248 --> 00:01:58.650
just spit-balling an argument
for an open marriage.

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:00.219
"Monogamy is a construct.

00:02:00.219 --> 00:02:02.421
When the priest said,
'Do you take this woman?',

00:02:02.421 --> 00:02:04.257
he wasn't pointing at anybody."

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:06.325
So there are a lot of dumb
takes out there

00:02:06.325 --> 00:02:07.994
about masks and vaccines.

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:09.863
By far, the worst take,
so far, came

00:02:09.863 --> 00:02:11.196 line:0%
from Marjorie Taylor Greene,

00:02:11.196 --> 00:02:13.766 line:0%
whose every utterance
sounds like it's coming

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:15.901
from someone
being dragged backwards

00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:18.538
out of a Costco,
grabbing at the DVD rack.

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:20.072
She's like the lady
at the PTA meeting

00:02:20.072 --> 00:02:22.741
who argues that math
violates the Constitution.

00:02:22.741 --> 00:02:24.043
"According
to the First Amendment,

00:02:24.043 --> 00:02:27.112
two plus two equals
whatever I say it does!"

00:02:27.112 --> 00:02:29.082
Ma'am, do you even have
a child at the school?

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:30.683
"Oh, I guess I need children

00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:32.285
to have an opinion
on the curriculum

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:34.220
for a school two towns
over from mine?

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.522
I didn't know I was living
in Soviet Russia."

00:02:36.522 --> 00:02:38.123 line:0%
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi
has decided

00:02:38.123 --> 00:02:40.627 line:0%
to keep the House's
massive mandate in place

00:02:40.627 --> 00:02:42.328 line:0%
until more Republicans
get vaccinated

00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:44.530 line:0%
because so many
have apparently refused.

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:47.367 line:0%
In a recent survey, for example,
CNN found that...

00:02:52.205 --> 00:02:53.306 line:0%
Meanwhile...

00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:59.678 line:0%
So, Pelosi said she'll keep
the House mask mandate

00:02:59.678 --> 00:03:01.548 line:0%
in place for now
an, in response,

00:03:01.548 --> 00:03:03.816 line:0%
Greene, who has a history
of anti-Semitism,

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:07.253
used an absolutely insane
and grotesque analogy.

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:09.021
-This woman is mentally ill.

00:03:09.021 --> 00:03:11.691
You know, we can look back
in a time in history

00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:14.293
where people were told
to wear a gold star

00:03:14.293 --> 00:03:17.796
and they were definitely treated
like second-class citizens,

00:03:17.796 --> 00:03:20.266
so much so that
they were put in trains

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:23.302
and taken to gas chambers
in Nazi Germany,

00:03:23.302 --> 00:03:25.771
and this is exactly
the type of abuse

00:03:25.771 --> 00:03:28.240
that Nancy Pelosi
is talking about.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.542
-She's mentally ill?

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:31.543
You just compared having
to wear a mask

00:03:31.543 --> 00:03:33.479
to prevent transmission
of a highly contagious

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:35.047
respiratory illness
to the Holocaust.

00:03:35.047 --> 00:03:36.615
I'd say you should be
wearing a straitjacket,

00:03:36.615 --> 00:03:39.686
but, with you, I'm guessing
a normal jacket put on backwards

00:03:39.686 --> 00:03:40.720
would probably do the trick.

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:42.021
"How do I get out of this?!

00:03:42.021 --> 00:03:44.223
The antifa Democrats have
trapped me in a windbreaker!

00:03:44.223 --> 00:03:46.325
This is just like Nazi Germany!"

00:03:46.325 --> 00:03:47.626
I mean, holy [bleep]

00:03:47.626 --> 00:03:49.661
As a general rule --
and this goes for everyone --

00:03:49.661 --> 00:03:51.731
don't compare anything
to the Holocaust, ever,

00:03:51.731 --> 00:03:54.400
especially if you're the lady
who famously said

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.802
wildfires are caused
by Jewish space lasers.

00:03:56.802 --> 00:03:58.871 line:0%
Who knows?
Maybe that'll be your excuse.

00:03:58.871 --> 00:04:00.372 line:0%
"I want to apologize
for my comments

00:04:00.372 --> 00:04:01.674 line:0%
comparing masks
to the Holocaust.

00:04:01.674 --> 00:04:03.710 line:0%
I don't know what got into me,
but I expect it was

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:05.411 line:0%
a ray beam
from a Jewish space laser.

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:06.645 line:0%
Do not wrestle the mic
away from me.

00:04:06.645 --> 00:04:08.314 line:0%
I'm making a very good point."

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:10.849 line:0%
Now, obviously,
the CDC guidance on masks

00:04:10.849 --> 00:04:13.119
for fully vaccinated
people has changed.

00:04:13.119 --> 00:04:15.387
That guidance is informed
by growing scientific evidence,

00:04:15.387 --> 00:04:17.756
as well as increasing
vaccination rates,

00:04:17.756 --> 00:04:20.392
which is why it's so frustrating
that so many Republicans,

00:04:20.392 --> 00:04:22.195
in Congress
and throughout the country,

00:04:22.195 --> 00:04:24.463
have said they won't
get vaccinated.

00:04:24.463 --> 00:04:26.065
Now, we've all been living

00:04:26.065 --> 00:04:27.800
with this pandemic
for 16 months, now,

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.235
and it's obviously
changed our behavior

00:04:29.235 --> 00:04:31.437
in some pretty dramatic ways,
which is totally understandable.

00:04:31.437 --> 00:04:34.406
I mean, early on, we all thought
we could catch COVID

00:04:34.406 --> 00:04:36.375
from our mail or our doorknobs.

00:04:36.375 --> 00:04:38.177
The science pretty quickly
showed us those scenarios

00:04:38.177 --> 00:04:40.212
are very unlikely,
but that hasn't stopped my wife

00:04:40.212 --> 00:04:41.447
from putting the mail
in the microwave

00:04:41.447 --> 00:04:43.315
and putting the microwave
in the dishwasher.

00:04:43.315 --> 00:04:44.717
No one --
[ Laughter ]

00:04:44.717 --> 00:04:46.919
I should stress, no one --
was more relieved to me

00:04:46.919 --> 00:04:49.788
to find out it was unlikely
to transmit via mail

00:04:49.788 --> 00:04:52.057
because, a bunch of times,
I told my wife

00:04:52.057 --> 00:04:54.827
I had wiped down the mail
when, in fact, I had not.

00:04:54.827 --> 00:04:56.829
[ Laughter ]
I just reached a breaking point

00:04:56.829 --> 00:05:00.132
where I would've preferred dying
to wiping down the mail again.

00:05:00.132 --> 00:05:02.402
It also did not help
that my mom -- true story --

00:05:02.402 --> 00:05:06.305
decided to send my kids a letter
a day for the entire pandemic.

00:05:06.305 --> 00:05:07.473
[ Laughter ]

00:05:07.473 --> 00:05:09.241
An incredible act of love
from a grandmother,

00:05:09.241 --> 00:05:11.910
but a total failure
to consider the circumstances.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:14.080
The only thing that could've
been more terrifying is

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.115
if she'd tied each letter
to a brick

00:05:16.115 --> 00:05:17.816
and chucked it
through our window.

00:05:17.816 --> 00:05:19.185
[ Laughter ]
But she's the best

00:05:19.185 --> 00:05:20.786
and I can't stay mad at her.

00:05:20.786 --> 00:05:21.988
Anyway, the point is
it takes time

00:05:21.988 --> 00:05:23.356
to break the habits
we've all formed

00:05:23.356 --> 00:05:25.257
during the pandemic,
like mask wearing.

00:05:25.257 --> 00:05:27.093
I've been fully vaccinated
for a while, now,

00:05:27.093 --> 00:05:28.594
and I still don't feel
totally comfortable

00:05:28.594 --> 00:05:31.097
showing people the lower
half of my face.

00:05:31.097 --> 00:05:32.231
It's like being the first person

00:05:32.231 --> 00:05:34.133
to take your shirt off
at a pool party.

00:05:34.133 --> 00:05:37.903
Like we all know we have to take
our shirts off, at some point,

00:05:37.903 --> 00:05:40.672
but being the first one
to do so is still weird.

00:05:40.672 --> 00:05:42.408
So then you start chanting
someone else's name,

00:05:42.408 --> 00:05:44.209
to make them go first,
and then, he does

00:05:44.209 --> 00:05:46.779
and he has a weird scar
and then you feel bad

00:05:46.779 --> 00:05:48.047
and it's still three hours

00:05:48.047 --> 00:05:49.782
before your mom
is due to pick you up.

00:05:49.782 --> 00:05:50.983
[ Laughter ]
Anyway.

00:05:50.983 --> 00:05:52.852
I'm sorry, Dave.
That was not cool of me.

00:05:52.852 --> 00:05:53.886
[ Laughter ]

00:05:53.886 --> 00:05:55.855
So, naturally, a lot of us

00:05:55.855 --> 00:05:57.289
were a little taken aback,
at first,

00:05:57.289 --> 00:06:00.126
when the CDC announced
a major shift earlier this month

00:06:00.126 --> 00:06:01.894
and said fully vaccinated adults

00:06:01.894 --> 00:06:05.764
no longer need to wear masks,
outdoors or indoors.

00:06:05.764 --> 00:06:08.567
Even businesses were unsure
how to react, at first,

00:06:08.567 --> 00:06:10.569
which left a lot
of people confused.

00:06:10.569 --> 00:06:12.471 line:0%
-A huge shift in life

00:06:12.471 --> 00:06:14.907 line:0%
as we have known it
for the last year and change.

00:06:14.907 --> 00:06:17.810 line:0%
If you are fully vaccinated,
the CDC now says,

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:21.580 line:0%
you can now ditch your mask,
outdoors and indoors.

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:24.484 line:0%
But again, that's only if you've
been fully vaccinated.

00:06:24.484 --> 00:06:26.152
-Tonight, at least 18 states

00:06:26.152 --> 00:06:28.521
already lifting
their mask mandates.

00:06:28.521 --> 00:06:30.589
But there are many businesses
across the country

00:06:30.589 --> 00:06:33.993
still concerned, still hoping
customers will wear masks.

00:06:33.993 --> 00:06:35.928
Many businesses still
deciding what they'll do.

00:06:35.928 --> 00:06:39.064
Kroger, for one, saying they
will keep the mask mandate.

00:06:39.064 --> 00:06:41.500
Target and Home Depot
doing the same.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.002
But Walmart tonight saying
they'll drop the masks.

00:06:44.002 --> 00:06:46.405
Trader Joe's was the first
major grocery store

00:06:46.405 --> 00:06:48.207
to drop the mask mandate today,

00:06:48.207 --> 00:06:50.409
as long as shoppers
are vaccinated.

00:06:50.409 --> 00:06:52.845
-First of all, I think
it's Kroger's, not Kroger.

00:06:52.845 --> 00:06:54.947
[ Laughter ]

00:06:54.947 --> 00:06:57.283
Second of all, of course
Trader Joe's was the first.

00:06:57.283 --> 00:06:58.884
I'm honestly shocked
Trader Joe's

00:06:58.884 --> 00:07:01.754
had any rules at all,
let alone a mask mandate.

00:07:01.754 --> 00:07:04.023
It's like if Jimmy Buffett
were a grocery store.

00:07:04.023 --> 00:07:05.091
One time, I bought some of their

00:07:05.091 --> 00:07:06.892
Everything but the Bagel
seasoning

00:07:06.892 --> 00:07:08.260
and it didn't have
a price on it,

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:10.729
so I asked the cashier how much
it cost and they said,

00:07:10.729 --> 00:07:12.765
"Whatever you want
to pay for it."

00:07:12.765 --> 00:07:15.368
And then, they whispered,
"You want to do a line?"

00:07:15.368 --> 00:07:17.135
[ Laughter ]
And I said, "A line

00:07:17.135 --> 00:07:19.071
of Everything but the Bagel
seasoning?"

00:07:19.071 --> 00:07:21.106
And they said,
"No, man, I'm just kidding."

00:07:21.106 --> 00:07:23.609
But I, for real,
don't think they were.

00:07:23.609 --> 00:07:24.610
[ Laughter ]

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:26.179 line:0%
The point is, it's confusing

00:07:26.179 --> 00:07:27.613
and everyone's doing their best.

00:07:27.613 --> 00:07:28.814
Even when you go get coffee,

00:07:28.814 --> 00:07:30.516 line:0%
you can see people trying
to thread the needle.

00:07:30.516 --> 00:07:32.618
Like they have a mask
around their ear

00:07:32.618 --> 00:07:35.554
or below their mouth
or my personal favorite --

00:07:35.554 --> 00:07:37.590
the wrist mask -- as if to say,

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:40.459
"I'm not going to wear it,
but I know about it."

00:07:40.459 --> 00:07:42.361 line:0%
And, look,
it's a complicated situation

00:07:42.361 --> 00:07:44.196 line:0%
and the science
is always evolving

00:07:44.196 --> 00:07:46.598 line:0%
and there are differing views
among epidemiologists

00:07:46.598 --> 00:07:48.934
and policymakers
about the best path forward.

00:07:48.934 --> 00:07:51.236
A lot of scientists
were expecting this guidance

00:07:51.236 --> 00:07:52.738
and agree with it,
but they just thought

00:07:52.738 --> 00:07:54.340
it would come a little later
this summer,

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:55.707
instead of earlier this month.

00:07:55.707 --> 00:07:57.310 line:0%
-I think what happened was

00:07:57.310 --> 00:08:00.712 line:0%
the CDC kind of got ahead
of everyone a little bit

00:08:00.712 --> 00:08:02.715 line:0%
and did it sooner
than most of us thought.

00:08:02.715 --> 00:08:05.084 line:0%
So I was expecting this
sometime in June.

00:08:05.084 --> 00:08:06.218 line:0%
It's a couple of weeks early.

00:08:06.218 --> 00:08:07.819 line:0%
I think it'll be okay.

00:08:07.819 --> 00:08:10.322 line:0%
But I think the stores,
the businesses,

00:08:10.322 --> 00:08:12.492 line:0%
the universities,
need a little time to catch up

00:08:12.492 --> 00:08:15.528 line:0%
and have some
internal discussions.

00:08:15.528 --> 00:08:17.262 line:0%
And, over time, over the summer,

00:08:17.262 --> 00:08:19.331 line:0%
as more and more people
get vaccinated,

00:08:19.331 --> 00:08:22.601 line:0%
as virus transmission
continues to decline,

00:08:22.601 --> 00:08:24.436 line:0%
people will have more
of a comfort level

00:08:24.436 --> 00:08:25.971 line:0%
with the new guidance.

00:08:25.971 --> 00:08:28.173
-It's true. The guidance
might've come a little early,

00:08:28.173 --> 00:08:30.442
but, eventually, hopefully,
it'll work itself out

00:08:30.442 --> 00:08:31.844
and people will get
comfortable with it.

00:08:31.844 --> 00:08:33.645
I know it's going
to take me some time.

00:08:33.645 --> 00:08:35.548
I mean, for one thing,
I'm still shocked,

00:08:35.548 --> 00:08:37.583
just to find out
what the entirety

00:08:37.583 --> 00:08:39.218
of people's faces look like.

00:08:39.218 --> 00:08:41.387
I thought it would be thrilling
to see the lower halves

00:08:41.387 --> 00:08:43.522
of the folks I met
during the pandemic

00:08:43.522 --> 00:08:44.990
and, instead, I'm shocked to see

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:47.759
how little they match
my expectations.

00:08:47.759 --> 00:08:49.361
It turns out the eyes
are no indicator

00:08:49.361 --> 00:08:51.630
of what's happening
from the nostril to the chin.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.065
This has been my reaction
to every person

00:08:53.065 --> 00:08:54.833
upon seeing their mouth
for the first time --

00:08:54.833 --> 00:08:56.002
Huh!

00:08:56.002 --> 00:08:59.272
[ Laughter ]

00:08:59.272 --> 00:09:02.508
Not what I would've thought!

00:09:02.508 --> 00:09:05.477
In some cases,
the bottom half reveal

00:09:05.477 --> 00:09:08.347
can completely change
how you feel about a person.

00:09:08.347 --> 00:09:11.817
Like I found out my new dentist
has a soul patch and, now,

00:09:11.817 --> 00:09:15.387
[ Laughter ]
I'm starting to doubt
the benefits of flossing.

00:09:15.387 --> 00:09:17.523
By the way, if you go somewhere
and they still have

00:09:17.523 --> 00:09:19.458
a mask policy,
don't be one of those people

00:09:19.458 --> 00:09:21.860
who thinks it's their
"Don't Tread on Me" moment.

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:24.597
You're not Ethan Allen
and this isn't Fort Ticonderoga.

00:09:24.597 --> 00:09:26.365
Just be cool and wear your mask.

00:09:26.365 --> 00:09:27.967
The key here is vaccination.

00:09:27.967 --> 00:09:29.467
That's what's
making this possible.

00:09:29.467 --> 00:09:32.204
About 60% of adults
have received at least one dose

00:09:32.204 --> 00:09:34.139
and the Biden administration
has set a goal

00:09:34.139 --> 00:09:38.210
of getting at least one dose
to 70% of Americans by July 4th.

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:39.445
And there's two reasons
for that.

00:09:39.445 --> 00:09:40.679
One, you're protecting yourself.

00:09:40.679 --> 00:09:43.015 line:0%
And two, the science is now
telling us

00:09:43.015 --> 00:09:46.118 line:0%
these vaccines are so effective,
you're also protecting others.

00:09:46.118 --> 00:09:48.520 line:0%
Because it's not just
that the vaccines

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:50.856 line:0%
are very likely
to keep you from getting sick.

00:09:50.856 --> 00:09:52.024 line:0%
There's now growing evidence

00:09:52.024 --> 00:09:54.327 line:0%
that they also strongly
curb transmission,

00:09:54.327 --> 00:09:56.361 line:0%
meaning that,
if you get vaccinated,

00:09:56.361 --> 00:09:59.098 line:0%
you're very unlikely to spread
coronavirus to others,

00:09:59.098 --> 00:10:00.933 line:0%
and that, that is huge.

00:10:00.933 --> 00:10:03.301 line:0%
Since we started vaccinating
people en masse

00:10:03.301 --> 00:10:05.437 line:0%
and collecting real-world data,

00:10:05.437 --> 00:10:08.641 line:0%
it became very clear that,
not only were vaccines

00:10:08.641 --> 00:10:10.776 line:0%
really good at keeping people
from getting sick,

00:10:10.776 --> 00:10:11.877 line:0%
they were also really good

00:10:11.877 --> 00:10:14.546 line:0%
at keeping people
from getting infected --

00:10:14.546 --> 00:10:16.816 line:0%
because you could be infected
without getting sick.

00:10:16.816 --> 00:10:18.517 line:0%
But then,
the third component was that,

00:10:18.517 --> 00:10:20.152 line:0%
even if you did get
an infection,

00:10:20.152 --> 00:10:21.887 line:0%
even if you tested positive
for COVID

00:10:21.887 --> 00:10:23.555 line:0%
after having been vaccinated,

00:10:23.555 --> 00:10:24.890 line:0%
it was very unlikely
you'd ever develop

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:28.094 line:0%
enough virus in your body
to then transmit it to others.

00:10:28.094 --> 00:10:29.528 line:0%
-There's a new piece of science,

00:10:29.528 --> 00:10:33.065 line:0%
and this is coming out of Israel
earlier this month,

00:10:33.065 --> 00:10:36.068 line:0%
that's showing that
vaccinated individuals,

00:10:36.068 --> 00:10:38.237 line:0%
if they do get
asymptomatic infection,

00:10:38.237 --> 00:10:41.607 line:0%
it's about 90% protective
against asymptomatic infection.

00:10:41.607 --> 00:10:44.110 line:0%
If they do get
asymptomatic infection,

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:47.546 line:0%
they're not shedding very much
virus from their nose and mouth,

00:10:47.546 --> 00:10:50.549 line:0%
so, even though they have
asymptomatic infection,

00:10:50.549 --> 00:10:54.386 line:0%
we think they're not actually
transmitting the virus,

00:10:54.386 --> 00:10:56.588 line:0%
and that's
really important news.

00:10:56.588 --> 00:10:58.690
-After this pandemic is over,
I never want to hear

00:10:58.690 --> 00:11:01.927
about shedding
from any orifice, ever again.

00:11:01.927 --> 00:11:03.262
Sounds like
some weird drug slang

00:11:03.262 --> 00:11:05.264
you'd hear at a rave
in Williamsburg.

00:11:05.264 --> 00:11:07.733
"Hey, man, do you shed
from the nose or the mouth?"

00:11:07.733 --> 00:11:08.967
Neither. I just do

00:11:08.967 --> 00:11:10.603
Everything but the Bagel
seasoning.

00:11:10.603 --> 00:11:11.903
[ Laughter ]
But that's how it works.

00:11:11.903 --> 00:11:14.172
When you get coronavirus
and you're not vaccinated,

00:11:14.172 --> 00:11:15.674
the virus develops in your body

00:11:15.674 --> 00:11:18.577
and you shed
from your nose and mouth.

00:11:18.577 --> 00:11:20.646
And, if you have an especially
high viral load,

00:11:20.646 --> 00:11:21.980
you can shed a lot.

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:24.483
And, if you're indoors,
with no ventilation and no masks

00:11:24.483 --> 00:11:27.119
and multiple people are
potentially shedding the virus,

00:11:27.119 --> 00:11:28.520
that's how you get
superspreader events,

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:29.654
especially if you're surrounded

00:11:29.654 --> 00:11:31.456
by a family of germ factory
mouth-breathers,

00:11:31.456 --> 00:11:33.993
like the Olympic bobshed team,
over here.

00:11:33.993 --> 00:11:36.695
Their noses flare like the
mainsails of a mighty schooner.

00:11:36.695 --> 00:11:38.663
These dudes are such heavy
mouth-breathers,

00:11:38.663 --> 00:11:40.265
when they suck in air,

00:11:40.265 --> 00:11:42.234
they sound like
a Dyson Airblade.

00:11:42.234 --> 00:11:43.736 line:0%
This is why vaccination
is the key

00:11:43.736 --> 00:11:44.770 line:0%
to getting rid of masks

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:46.004 line:0%
and it's also why it's a problem

00:11:46.004 --> 00:11:49.074 line:0%
that so many Republicans
in Congress, and in polls,

00:11:49.074 --> 00:11:50.375
said they won't get vaccinated.

00:11:50.375 --> 00:11:52.311
Now, to their credit,
some Republican politicians

00:11:52.311 --> 00:11:54.913
have put out videos urging
people to take the vaccine,

00:11:54.913 --> 00:11:57.182
like Louisiana
Senator John Kennedy, although,

00:11:57.182 --> 00:12:00.018
I'm not sure how effective
his messaging has been.

00:12:00.018 --> 00:12:02.287
-♪ Born free ♪

00:12:02.287 --> 00:12:06.058
♪ As free as the wind blows ♪

00:12:06.058 --> 00:12:09.461
♪ As free
as the grass grows ♪

00:12:09.461 --> 00:12:12.931
♪ Born free
to follow your heart ♪

00:12:12.931 --> 00:12:14.466
♪ Live free ♪

00:12:14.466 --> 00:12:17.403
♪ And beauty surrounds you ♪

00:12:17.403 --> 00:12:20.306
♪ The world still astounds you ♪

00:12:20.306 --> 00:12:24.175
♪ Each time you look at a star ♪

00:12:24.175 --> 00:12:26.512
I'm Senator John Kennedy.

00:12:26.512 --> 00:12:29.047
I can't sing very well,
but I'm free.

00:12:29.047 --> 00:12:31.617
Be free. Be cool.

00:12:31.617 --> 00:12:33.318
Get the vaccine.

00:12:33.318 --> 00:12:34.386
I did.
[ Laughter ]

00:12:34.386 --> 00:12:36.088
It works.

00:12:36.088 --> 00:12:37.556
-Are you ready to go,
Senator Kennedy?

00:12:37.556 --> 00:12:40.392
[ As Kennedy ]
I am, but I'm going to do
the whole verse.

00:12:40.392 --> 00:12:43.161
[ Laughter ]

00:12:43.161 --> 00:12:44.829
We don't think -- You don't need
to do the whole --

00:12:44.829 --> 00:12:47.132
I think, if we just get
"Born free" out there,

00:12:47.132 --> 00:12:48.300
it will be fine with that.

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:49.835
[ As Kennedy ]
I'm going to do the whole verse.

00:12:49.835 --> 00:12:52.170
[ Laughter ]

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:54.039
Is tone-deafness one
of the side effects?

00:12:54.039 --> 00:12:55.741
[ Laughter ]
You sound like

00:12:55.741 --> 00:12:56.975
a dying cat.

00:12:56.975 --> 00:12:58.843
I'm not sure
if I should congratulate you

00:12:58.843 --> 00:12:59.845
for being pro-vaccine

00:12:59.845 --> 00:13:00.946
or rush you to the vet.

00:13:00.946 --> 00:13:02.747
I can't believe
I'm saying this, but,

00:13:02.747 --> 00:13:05.183
maybe take singing lessons
from Chuck Schumer?

00:13:05.183 --> 00:13:09.221
-♪ Right at the very
start of it ♪

00:13:09.221 --> 00:13:13.458
♪ New York, New York ♪

00:13:13.458 --> 00:13:15.060
-[ As Schumer ]
New York is back, baby!

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:17.829
[ Laughter ]
We may not have Broadway, yet,

00:13:17.829 --> 00:13:20.499
but, until then, we'll have
to settle for Chuck S,

00:13:20.499 --> 00:13:23.368
aka Public Enema.
[ Laughter ]

00:13:23.368 --> 00:13:26.738
I wonder if his kids got
vaccinated for embarrassment.

00:13:26.738 --> 00:13:28.173
You know, I don't
always agree with Chuck,

00:13:28.173 --> 00:13:29.975
but you do have to admire
how much he's enjoying himself.

00:13:29.975 --> 00:13:31.643
Trump's gone,
Senate majority leader,

00:13:31.643 --> 00:13:34.012
he's vaxxed, relaxed,
and living it to the max.

00:13:34.012 --> 00:13:35.714
It's the summer of Chuck!

00:13:35.714 --> 00:13:37.849
That's the life you could be
living, if you got vaccinated.

00:13:37.849 --> 00:13:40.619
Unfortunately, there are still
too many prominent Republicans

00:13:40.619 --> 00:13:43.088
lying about the vaccines
and bragging about the fact

00:13:43.088 --> 00:13:44.289
that they won't get vaccinated,

00:13:44.289 --> 00:13:46.759 line:0%
like Wisconsin Senator
Ron Johnson,

00:13:46.759 --> 00:13:48.227 line:0%
who has suggested there might be

00:13:48.227 --> 00:13:50.829 line:0%
some sort of shadowy plot
behind the vaccine push,

00:13:50.829 --> 00:13:53.499
or Senator Rand Paul,
who announced over the weekend

00:13:53.499 --> 00:13:55.467
that he won't be
getting vaccinated.

00:14:08.647 --> 00:14:10.348
Look, if you're
comfortable getting by

00:14:10.348 --> 00:14:12.317
with what your body
produces on its own,

00:14:12.317 --> 00:14:14.986
then you should take off that
regional theater wig of yours,

00:14:14.986 --> 00:14:16.521
[ Laughter ]
Now, look, obviously,

00:14:16.521 --> 00:14:19.591
you're allowed to make
your own personal decisions.

00:14:19.591 --> 00:14:21.660
No one's going to strap you
to a gurney

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:23.262
and inject you with a vaccine.

00:14:23.262 --> 00:14:25.263
This isn't
a "Clockwork Orange" situation,

00:14:25.263 --> 00:14:27.566
even though Rudy Giuliani
does always look like

00:14:27.566 --> 00:14:29.067
he's strapped to a chair
and being forced

00:14:29.067 --> 00:14:30.502
to watch his scene in "Borat."

00:14:30.502 --> 00:14:32.871
[ As Giuliani ]
How did I not know
it was a setup?!

00:14:32.871 --> 00:14:35.307 line:0%
Also, Senator, you're wrong,
about a bunch of things.

00:14:35.307 --> 00:14:37.009 line:0%
For one thing,
the CDC still recommends

00:14:37.009 --> 00:14:38.944 line:0%
getting vaccinated,
even if you had COVID.

00:14:38.944 --> 00:14:41.313 line:0%
And, perhaps most importantly,
as we already explained,

00:14:41.313 --> 00:14:42.714 line:0%
it's not just about you.

00:14:42.714 --> 00:14:44.749 line:0%
It's about preventing
transmission to others

00:14:44.749 --> 00:14:46.051 line:0%
and, as we just explained,

00:14:46.051 --> 00:14:49.254 line:0%
the evidence suggests
vaccines do that.

00:14:49.254 --> 00:14:51.023
For some reason,
that's the point

00:14:51.023 --> 00:14:52.824
these right-wingers
all refuse to acknowledge --

00:14:52.824 --> 00:14:53.858
it's not just about you.

00:14:53.858 --> 00:14:55.594
It's about protecting everyone.

00:14:55.594 --> 00:14:56.895
And, yet, these people refuse,

00:14:56.895 --> 00:14:58.530
either because they don't care
or because they have

00:14:58.530 --> 00:14:59.831
the self-entitlement
of someone...

00:14:59.831 --> 00:15:04.269 line:0%
-Driving down the freeway
at 55 or 70 or 80 miles an hour.

00:15:04.269 --> 00:15:05.771
-This has been
"A Closer Look."

00:15:05.771 --> 00:15:09.774
♪♪

00:15:09.774 --> 00:15:11.410
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:12.711
over two million meals a year

00:15:12.711 --> 00:15:15.847
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:15:15.847 --> 00:15:17.515
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:15:17.515 --> 00:15:19.217
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:15:19.217 --> 00:15:21.319
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:15:21.319 --> 00:15:23.221
Stay safe.
Wear a mask.

00:15:23.221 --> 00:15:25.391
Get vaccinated.
We love you.

